   "text": "Glion - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nGlion\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nSince 1962, Glion Institute of Higher Education has set the highest standards for academic quality and hospitality excellence. It ranks among the world’s top institutions for hospitality and leisure management, and in the Top 2 globally for employer reputation. With campuses in Switzerland and London, Glion delivers a premium, personalized education combining practical skills with academic rigor.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n08/05/2026 07:08\nby Gunia Beniwal\nCreated\n29/10/2020 14:46\nby Data Migration\nType\nUniversity\nCountry\nSwitzerland\nYearly Fees\nMax: CHF 42,638.00\nMin: CHF 33,251.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n85%\n1,360 of 1,600 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPrivate\nProvider\nDirect QS\nFounded Year\n1962\nCampus(es)\nGlion, Bulle\nCountry\nSwitzerland\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n01/11/2020\nContract End Date\n01/01/2036\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nOn campus accommodation is available for all students\nScholarship Offered\n-\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Y8wtlN2z6p8\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ix7Rvmadoog\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Y8wtlN2z6p8\nInternship Details\nCo-ops and internships are an essential part of all programs.\nAdditional Information\n-",
